graph LR
    A[User opens My Collection] --> B[Set icons load from Scryfall SVGs]
    B --> C{Icon loads?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Show set symbol icon]
    C -->|No| E[Show 3-letter set code text]
    D --> F[User hovers icon]
    F --> G[Tooltip shows full set name]
    D --> H[User clicks icon]
    H --> I[Cards filter by selected set]
    I --> J[User clicks icon again]
    J --> K[Filter cleared - show all]
